      {
        "id": "fig30-clear-point-relations",
        "description": "Five independently read filled markers: (1,6),(2,10),(3,14),(4,18),(5,22). Each next marker moves half a grid cell right and two rows up. Intrinsic upper ROI shows guide/grid strokes, not an independently enlarged additional marker; neither (6,26) nor (7,30) is authored as a data point.",
