        "requires": [
          "pointRelationships"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "fig30-broken-trace",
        "description": "Source rising dashed guide through all five plotted markers, continuing above and below them inside the common grid. Modern regular dash spacing and clipping endpoints (-2,-6)/(7,30) construct the straight guide at the frame boundary; these are not source labelled terminal coordinates and do not create visible point objects.",
